L32: Experimental design
L33: The subjects reported to the laboratory on eight separate occasions over a ~4-week period. During the first visit to the laboratory, subjects initially performed a ramp incremental test for assessment of ramp test peak power and peak  \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
